    "voices": [
      {
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/yang-fan/voice/frozen/yang-fan__voice__intro__v1.wav",
        "source": "voices/yang-fan/yang-fan__voice__intro__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "231cae0305e4414bc83c97ba6b1b511ab789f6a026bbcbe73c1872b0766d9e58",
        "bytes": 1337798,
        "slot": "intro",
        "version": 1,
        "placeholder": true,
        "transcript": "你好，我叫杨帆，三十岁，云南大理人。发髻和这点小胡子留习惯了，总有人问我是不是拍古装戏的。其实我是航空公司的副机长。工作时按规程来，休息时就喜欢慢慢走，看看天，不用每朵云都赶着穿过去。"
      },
      {
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/yang-fan/voice/frozen/yang-fan__voice__intro-alt__v1.wav",
        "source": "voices/yang-fan/yang-fan__voice__intro-alt__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "53de5aac23302211f2239161d0ccce31674695a2ad8997b57ac610b12375f1df",
        "bytes": 1271094,
        "slot": "intro-alt",
        "version": 1,
        "placeholder": true,
        "transcript": "Hello, I'm Yang Fan, thirty, from Dali in Yunnan. With this little bun and goatee, people often ask if I act in costume dramas. I'm actually an airline first officer. At work I follow the checklist carefully. On my days off, I enjoy a slow walk and a good view of the sky."
      },
      {
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/yang-fan/voice/frozen/yang-fan__voice__chat__v1.wav",
        "source": "voices/yang-fan/yang-fan__voice__chat__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "eb1acf282b78f216a73eaa19f49bfcaf38b581626c9ad0eab389ec9cfe82cc72",
        "bytes": 564584,
        "slot": "chat",
        "version": 1,
        "placeholder": true,
        "transcript": "今天风不大，咱们沿湖走一段吧。别急着拍照，先看一会儿。等云从山后面出来，光落下来，那个时候再拍。"
      },
      {
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/yang-fan/voice/frozen/yang-fan__voice__happy__v1.wav",
        "source": "voices/yang-fan/yang-fan__voice__happy__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "ebe40413e36e9fb03bea620fe89f9bdabb4b92be72928df96888d937a4ee133b",
        "bytes": 669352,
        "slot": "happy",
        "version": 1,
        "placeholder": true,
        "transcript": "听见了？今天终于把休假凑到一起了。那就不排太满，吃顿饭，走走路，能跟你们坐着聊一下午，我就很高兴。"
      },
      {
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/yang-fan/voice/frozen/yang-fan__voice__angry__v1.wav",
        "source": "voices/yang-fan/yang-fan__voice__angry__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "bb4e445de833fe7cb12b1d7a8378447cde1b7454910b0739ae5cf53b9a7b357d",
        "bytes": 636658,
        "slot": "angry",
        "version": 1,
        "placeholder": true,
        "transcript": "先停一下，这一步还没核对。不能因为赶时间就跳过去。你把记录拿来，我们一项一项确认，确认完再继续。"
      },
      {
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/yang-fan/voice/frozen/yang-fan__voice__sad__v1.wav",
        "source": "voices/yang-fan/yang-fan__voice__sad__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "a3fb440360b02e3d86d01ab0e76fe6f4dbd33cddd2043c08bd933a103a727afb",
        "bytes": 727308,
        "slot": "sad",
        "version": 1,
        "placeholder": true,
        "transcript": "原来常走的那条小路，现在修了新的围栏。我站在外面看了半天，才发现自己记得的样子，已经是好多年前了。"
      }
